<!doctype lake><title>🕊️ 𝓶𝓲𝓭-𝓽𝓻𝓪𝓲𝓷𝓲𝓷𝓰</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="ysjCY" id="ysjCY" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u6520d165" id="u6520d165">🦜</span><span data-lake-id="ubdce874e" id="ubdce874e"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c092c8c" id="u7c092c8c">𝐃𝐨𝐞𝐬 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐲 𝐈𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐢𝐳𝐞 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐂𝐚𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐢𝐧 𝐋𝐋𝐌𝐬 𝐁𝐞𝐲𝐨𝐧𝐝 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u4af94d72" id="u4af94d72"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d43412a" id="u2d43412a">以推理为核心的大语言模型，例如 OpenAI-o1、DeepSeek-R1 和 Kimi-1.5，显著拓展大语言模型的能力边界，尤其是在解决涉及数学与编程的复杂逻辑任务方面。与依赖人工整理标注数据的传统指令微调方法相比，推动这一能力跃升的关键因素是大规模的可验证奖励强化学习</span></strong></p><ul list="ue62becfa"><li fid="u771121f4" data-lake-id="u6676eb66" id="u6676eb66"><span data-lake-id="uae4b48f4" id="uae4b48f4">RLVR 以预训练基座模型或经过长思维链数据微调的模型为起点，基于简单且能够自动计算的奖励，通过强化学习对模型进行优化。这些奖励由模型输出是否与数学问题的标准解一致，或生成的代码是否通过单元测试来确定，从而能够在无需人工标注的情况下扩展训练规模</span></li><li fid="u771121f4" data-lake-id="u80bcf0ff" id="u80bcf0ff"><span data-lake-id="uc5d8f31c" id="uc5d8f31c">由于方法简单且具有实际效果，这一框架受到广泛关注。在游戏等传统强化学习场景中，例如 Atari 和围棋，智能体往往能够自主发现新策略，并通过自我改进达到甚至超越人类水平</span></li><li fid="u771121f4" data-lake-id="u9b484829" id="u9b484829"><span data-lake-id="u7199fe5f" id="u7199fe5f">受这些成功案例的启发，人们普遍认为，RLVR 同样能够使大语言模型自主形成新的推理模式，包括枚举、自我反思和迭代改进，从而超越其基座模型的能力。因此，RLVR 被视为实现大语言模型持续自我进化的一条潜在路径</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u26fe0e9e" id="u26fe0e9e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uda6948bb" id="uda6948bb" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，尽管 RLVR 在实证中取得成功，当前方法究竟如何发挥作用，仍未得到充分研究。这引出一个根本性问题：当前的 RLVR 是否真正使大语言模型获得新的推理能力，如同传统强化学习通过探索发现新策略一样；还是说，它只是利用基座模型中已经存在的推理模式？</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub0337c3e" id="ub0337c3e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uca153d5d" id="uca153d5d">为严谨地回答这一问题，首先需要评估基座模型与经过 RLVR 训练的模型各自的推理能力边界。传统评估指标依赖于贪心解码或核采样所得到的平均得分，反映的是模型在平均情况下的表现</span></strong></p><ul list="u6b894669"><li fid="u10cb8b62" data-lake-id="uef679ed9" id="uef679ed9"><span data-lake-id="uec02c1fe" id="uec02c1fe">这些指标可能低估模型的真实潜力：模型可能在有限次数的尝试后未能解决某个困难问题，但通过更多次采样，仍然能够找到解答</span></li><li fid="u10cb8b62" data-lake-id="u47f681bf" id="u47f681bf"><span data-lake-id="u7d729184" id="u7d729184">为克服这一局限，采用 pass@</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gKrvn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3c593f2" id="uf3c593f2">：只要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hJKcj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc67146c" id="ubc67146c">个采样输出中存在一个正确答案，就认为该问题已被解决。通过允许多次尝试，pass@</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gBurj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud90f13cb" id="ud90f13cb">能够揭示模型是否具备解决某个问题的潜力</span></li><li fid="u10cb8b62" data-lake-id="u8e315600" id="u8e315600"><span data-lake-id="u15bbf6d4" id="u15bbf6d4">整个数据集上的平均 pass@</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KHKUu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9641d019" id="u9641d019"> 反映模型在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cOWbj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7632b769" id="u7632b769">次尝试内可能解决的问题比例，从而更稳健地刻画其推理能力边界。这为检验 RLVR 训练是否带来根本性的能力突破，即是否使模型能够解决基座模型无法解决的问题，提供一种严谨的评估方法</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u24f62aca" id="u24f62aca" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791013770246-157e7fac-4e80-4f98-be16-236ab8816eba.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4d8ca56c-3af9-47ae-8190-cd5d47ae031%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8ffbd1c8-dc3f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A700.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A221%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A238774%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1278%2C%22originHeight%22%3A403%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22248163264128256%22%2C%22x%22%3A973%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A277%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMNI-MATH-TRAIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A979%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NUMBEROFSAMPLESK%22%2C%22x%22%3A977%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A896%2C%22y%22%3A73%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A231%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EFFICIENTSAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A380%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASEMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RLVRMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONINGCAPACIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A377%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%85%92%22%2C%22x%22%3A915%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A237%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRPO-STEP3OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1112%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REDUCEDSCOPEOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A381%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QWEN2.5-7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1108%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRPO-STEP1S%22%2C%22x%22%3A1110%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A498%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A235%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRPO-STEP4S0%22%2C%22x%22%3A1103%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROBLEMA%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROBLEMB%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1052%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A64%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2200%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A910%2C%22y%22%3A233%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A107%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f4f3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc72f16ff%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucb2aceda" id="ucb2aceda"><strong><span data-lake-id="u967838e5" id="u967838e5">当前 RLVR 模型的推理覆盖范围比其基座模型更窄</span></strong></p><ul list="u3d1fba3e"><li fid="ucda5a946" data-lake-id="ue03359b3" id="ue03359b3"><span data-lake-id="u7bf07648" id="u7bf07648">在 pass@</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ypx5V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3665356" id="uf3665356"> 曲线中，虽然 RLVR 模型在较小的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MoG5j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30477733" id="u30477733">下优于其基座模型，但随着 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vicQs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4738990" id="ue4738990"> 增大，基座模型在所有受测基准和模型家族上都一致地超越 RLVR 模型。这表明，当前 RLVR 训练并未扩大模型能够解决的问题范围，甚至会缩小这一范围</span></li><li fid="ucda5a946" data-lake-id="ubc0a6a29" id="ubc0a6a29"><span data-lake-id="u76b43f5f" id="u76b43f5f">对模型回答的人工检查显示，对于大多数问题，基座模型都能够生成至少一条正确的 CoT。这意味着，对于此前被认为只有 RLVR 模型才能解决的问题，基座模型实际上已经能够生成正确的推理路径</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u42c6699c" id="u42c6699c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8724623d" id="u8724623d">当前 RLVR 模型生成的推理路径已经存在于其基座模型之中</span></strong></p><ul list="u312bfc01"><li fid="ue4d15666" data-lake-id="u015070ff" id="u015070ff"><span data-lake-id="uff1352b0" id="uff1352b0">虽然 RLVR 能够通过更高效地采样基座模型原本就能解决的问题的正确答案，改善平均表现，即 pass@1，但它并未使模型能够解决新的问题</span></li><li fid="ue4d15666" data-lake-id="u13aafd64" id="u13aafd64"><span data-lake-id="udf5a9e8f" id="udf5a9e8f">进一步的困惑度分析表明，RLVR 模型生成的推理路径已经存在于基座模型的输出分布中。RLVR 并未引入根本性的新推理能力，当前 RLVR 模型的推理能力仍受到其基座模型能力的限制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u148d3b12" id="u148d3b12"><strong><span data-lake-id="u29639091" id="u29639091">当前 RLVR 算法的表现相近，并且距离最优状态仍有较大差距</span></strong></p><ul list="uf8a7288d"><li fid="udd007549" data-lake-id="uaa03ddd3" id="uaa03ddd3"><span data-lake-id="u2d54790a" id="u2d54790a">将基座模型视为能力上界，定义采样效率差距</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSE%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7510e80ed54cfdc44aef550bb7759268.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JanZK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4751788d" id="u4751788d">。该指标表示 RL 模型的 pass@1 与基座模型的 pass@</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g9qI2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua06705db" id="ua06705db"> 之间的差距，其中取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%20%3D%20256%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab808cf415013f59b03435d3784f7d91.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wDfN3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96bbb910" id="u96bbb910">，作为性能上界的近似。该指标用于量化某种 RL 算法接近最优上界的程度。在所有算法中，例如 PPO、GRPO 和 Reinforce++，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSE%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7510e80ed54cfdc44aef550bb7759268.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IjiCX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30fd9f10" id="u30fd9f10"> 的变化幅度都较小，但其数值始终较大。这表明，尽管当前 RLVR 方法提高采样效率，它们距离最优状态仍然很远</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufeab56f6" id="ufeab56f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub1df7b0f" id="ub1df7b0f">RLVR 与蒸馏存在根本区别：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u828b7bb3" id="u828b7bb3">RLVR 通过更高效地采样高奖励输出来提高推理得分，但它并未激发新的推理能力，其作用仍受限于基座模型的能力范围。相比之下，蒸馏能够将更强教师模型中的新推理模式迁移至学生模型。因此，经过蒸馏的模型往往能够展现出超越基座模型的推理覆盖范围</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="tXwtO" id="tXwtO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1ec0452c" id="u1ec0452c"> </span><span data-lake-id="u740ca7fb" id="u740ca7fb">🐋</span><span data-lake-id="ub4fad17d" id="ub4fad17d"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩 𝐀𝐧𝐚𝐥𝐲𝐬𝐢𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u7c422795" id="u7c422795"><strong><span data-lake-id="u845a345a" id="u845a345a" style="color: #664900">4.1 Reasoning Paths Already Present in Base Models</span></strong></p><ul list="uc9e29cab"><li fid="u92362a12" data-lake-id="u91da4c7f" id="u91da4c7f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34cd9f70" id="u34cd9f70">准确率分布：RLVR 把质量推向两端，并增加 0 分桶</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u070374bb" id="u070374bb">：RLVR 会增加接近 1.0 的高准确率频次、减少中低准确率频次；但反常的是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u97febc2c" id="u97febc2c">accuracy=0 的频次上升</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4551d7b2" id="u4551d7b2">，这意味着</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e5db6a5" id="u3e5db6a5">更多题从偶尔能解变成完全解不</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u608c529f" id="u608c529f">。因此平均分（如 pass@1）提升，并不是因为解锁新题，而是因为对原本可解题的正确路径采样更高效</span></li><li fid="u92362a12" data-lake-id="ua6f27cf5" id="ua6f27cf5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u088cebb3" id="u088cebb3">可解题集合关系：RL 模型解出的题几乎是 base 的子集</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u43f505b9" id="u43f505b9">：在 AIME24(k=1024) 与 MATH500(k=128) 上做可解/不可解集合对比：大量是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u88b3bb68" id="u88b3bb68">base ✓、RL ✗</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8a996771" id="u8a996771">，而 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2ac99ed1" id="u2ac99ed1">base ✗、RL ✓</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaa3b26ef" id="uaa3b26ef"> 几乎没有（AIME24 甚至为 0%）。这直接支持RLVR 没有扩展边界，反而丢掉一部分边界</span></li><li fid="u92362a12" data-lake-id="ufbc7c35d" id="ufbc7c35d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue4db5dac" id="ue4db5dac">困惑度（PPL）证据：RL 输出在 base 分布中本来就概率很高：RL 产出的推理轨迹在 base 看来本就很可预测/高概率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubcfd3e94" id="ubcfd3e94">；暗示 RLVR 主要是在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u38275d43" id="u38275d43">base 先验内部变尖/锐化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u695391d0" id="u695391d0">，而不是向外扩展</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u329d0bda" id="u329d0bda"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9868ce9b" id="u9868ce9b" style="color: #664900">4.2 Distillation Expands the Reasoning Boundary</span></strong></p><ul list="ue3b6c902"><li fid="uba5bf273" data-lake-id="u97b93b8e" id="u97b93b8e"><span data-lake-id="u34f40c35" id="u34f40c35">作者把</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ece84b3" id="u9ece84b3">蒸馏</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue03c136e" id="ue03c136e">拿来对照：蒸馏数据是 teacher 产生的长 CoT 轨迹，因此能把新推理模式注入 student。实验里 distilled 模型的 pass@k 曲线 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf32a60af" id="uf32a60af">整体显著高于 base</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u29015077" id="u29015077">，这被解释为：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5952d994" id="u5952d994">蒸馏确实能扩展 base 的推理边界，而 RLVR 通常做不到</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u018fd6da" id="u018fd6da">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u40c414c0" id="u40c414c0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5664170" id="uf5664170" style="color: #664900">4.3 Effects of Different RL Algorithms</span></strong></p><ul list="ud3e39763"><li fid="u50ed2fe8" data-lake-id="uac56ff8f" id="uac56ff8f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5784391f" id="u5784391f">提出指标：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7b4910b8" id="u7b4910b8">把 base 的 pass@k（用 k=256 近似上界）当作潜力上界，定义 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud6e544c8" id="ud6e544c8">ΔSE = (RL 的 pass@1) − (base 的 pass@256)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueeb60f20" id="ueeb60f20">，越小表示 RL 越接近把 base 潜力压到一次采样里</span></li><li fid="u50ed2fe8" data-lake-id="u5dcbeadb" id="u5dcbeadb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11174ee0" id="u11174ee0">结论：多种 RL 算法差异不本质，且距离“最优采样效率”仍很远</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1442451e" id="u1442451e">。在统一实现/设置下比较 PPO、GRPO、Reinforce++、RLOO、ReMax、DAPO：ΔSE 在算法间只有小幅波动，但整体仍很大（文中提到在 in-domain 上仍有 40+ points 量级的差距），说明</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4cf9218e" id="u4cf9218e">现有 RLVR 算法普遍远未充分榨干 base 潜力</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u01a67e12" id="u01a67e12">，可能需要新范式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u749712d8" id="u749712d8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1767162380570-719b4d76-12c0-4492-b5eb-bb218136c6fa.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7c9f763d-a4b2-48a1-9118-30185367754%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc61c3d46-f16b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A711.6666870117188%2C%22height%22%3A395%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A184414%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1249%2C%22originHeight%22%3A694%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMNI-MATH-TEST(INDOMAIN)MATHS00(OUTOFDOMAIN)%22%2C%22x%22%3A394%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A675%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMNI-MATH-TESTINDOMAIN)MATHS00(OU%22%2C%22x%22%3A393%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%2