ata-lake-id="ud96da114" id="ud96da114"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fca59cf" id="u0fca59cf">rollout 数 n：增大 n（8→32）只能小幅改善，仍会被 base 在大 k 超越</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9067304c" id="u9067304c">。增加每个 prompt 的采样数能带来些许提升，但整体趋势不变</span></li><li fid="ue3c96f85" data-lake-id="u97990138" id="u97990138"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud30e98bf" id="ud30e98bf">KL 正则：会显著伤害高 k 覆盖</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u60e3abc8" id="u60e3abc8">：加入 KL penalty（系数 0.001）后，pass@1 类似，但 pass@128 大幅更低，说明约束偏离可能进一步压缩探索/多样性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2950e40b" id="u2950e40b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1767162428469-d72b8191-2bc1-49da-99a4-e16d54e59485.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf8c04b6d-091d-48c0-a1b5-4f162c93864%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc61c3d46-f16b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A664.6666870117188%2C%22height%22%3A250%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A87701%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1219%2C%22originHeight%22%3A458%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%221248163264128256%22%2C%22x%22%3A848%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A327%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22248163264128256%22%2C%22x%22%3A482%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A313%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NUMBEROFSAMPLESK%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A271%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NUMBEROFSAMPLESK%22%2C%22x%22%3A875%2C%22y%22%3A366%2C%22width%22%3A273%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221248163264128256%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A335%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NUMBEROFSAMPLESK%22%2C%22x%22%3A110%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A276%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMNI-MATH-TRAIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A124%2C%22y%22