 Effects of Entropy</span></strong></p><ul list="u47c663a6"><li fid="u25383403" data-lake-id="uff724e52" id="uff724e52"><span data-lake-id="u03a4326e" id="u03a4326e">RL 训练常让输出熵下降（更确定、更不发散），这可能导致覆盖面下降。为此他们把 RL 模型温度调高以匹配 base 的熵：pass@k 略有改善，但仍全面落后 base，说明 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u44b93b0e" id="u44b93b0e">熵下降只是部分原因，不是全部解释</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubd1f6c34" id="ubd1f6c34" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1767162515166-ef578428-e9d5-4172-8db3-654aff03a294.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ude1f9e3c-4d90-43eb-9366-ef79a523a50%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc61c3d46-f16b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A611.3333740234375%2C%22height%22%3A375%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A147872%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1265%2C%22originHeight%22%3A777%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MINERVA(EBASE0.63)%22%2C%22x%22%3A498%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A283%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MATH500(EBASE%3D0.72)%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A306%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GSM8K(EBASE-0.75)%22%2C%22x%22%3A856%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A281%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AME24(EBASE%3D0.47%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A288%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AMC23EBASE-0.51%22%2C%22x%22%3A497%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A270%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OLYMPIADEBASEE0.5)%22%2C%22x%22%3A857%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A282%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216642561024%22%2C%22x%22%3A590%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A214%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2248163264128%22%2C%22x%22%3A911%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A245%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%